        <mxCell id="X1T8AUEm6M4d00yeZ6nz-1" parent="X1T8AUEm6M4d00yeZ6nz-3" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1080" width="1796.21" x="91.88999999999987" y="28" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X1T8AUEm6M4d00yeZ6nz-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;NetBox functions as the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;source of truth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for your network infrastructure. Its job is to define and validate the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;intended state&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of all network components and resources. NetBox does not interact with network nodes directly; rather, it makes this data available programmatically to purpose-built automation, monitoring, and assurance tools. This separation of duties enables the construction of a robust yet flexible automation system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;The diagram above illustrates the recommended deployment architecture for an automated network, leveraging NetBox as the central authority for network state. This approach allows your team to swap out individual tools to meet changing needs while retaining a predictable, modular workflow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25; border-bottom: 0.625px solid rgba(61, 68, 77, 0.7); padding-bottom: 0.3em;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Why NetBox?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-why-netbox&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Why NetBox?&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#why-netbox&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 18.9062px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(calc(-50% - 0.3rem)); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Data Model&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-comprehensive-data-model&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Comprehensive Data Model&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#comprehensive-data-model&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Racks, devices, cables, IP addresses, VLANs, circuits, power, VPNs, and lots more: NetBox is built for networks. Its comprehensive and thoroughly inter-linked data model provides for natural and highly structured modeling of myriad network primitives that just isn&#39;t possible using general-purpose tools. And there&#39;s no need to waste time contemplating how to build out a database: Everything is ready to go upon installation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Focused Development&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-focused-development&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Focused Development&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#focused-development&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;NetBox strives to meet a singular goal: Provide the best available solution for making network infrastructure programmatically accessible. Unlike &quot;all-in-one&quot; tools which awkwardly bolt on half-baked features in an attempt to check every box, NetBox is committed to its core function. NetBox provides the best possible solution for modeling network infrastructure, and provides rich APIs for integrating with tools that excel in other areas of network automation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Extensible and Customizable&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-extensible-and-customizable&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Extensible and Customizable&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#extensible-and-customizable&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;No two networks are exactly the same. Users are empowered to extend NetBox&#39;s native data model with custom fields and tags to best suit their unique needs. You can even write your own plugins to introduce entirely new objects and functionality!&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Flexible Permissions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-flexible-permissions&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Flexible Permissions&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#flexible-permissions&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;NetBox includes a fully customizable permission system, which affords administrators incredible granularity when assigning roles to users and groups. Want to restrict certain users to working only with cabling and not be able to change IP addresses? Or maybe each team should have access only to a particular tenant? NetBox enables you to craft roles as you see fit.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Custom Validation &amp;amp; Protection Rules&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-custom-validation--protection-rules&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Custom Validation &amp;amp; Protection Rules&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#custom-validation--protection-rules&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The data you put into NetBox is crucial to network operations. In addition to its robust native validation rules, NetBox provides mechanisms for administrators to define their own custom validation rules for objects. Custom validation can be used both to ensure new or modified objects adhere to a set of rules, and to prevent the deletion of objects which don&#39;t meet certain criteria. (For example, you might want to prevent the deletion of a device with an &quot;active&quot; status.)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Device Configuration Rendering&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-device-configuration-rendering&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Device Configuration Rendering&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#device-configuration-rendering&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;NetBox can render user-created Jinja2 templates to generate device configurations from its own data. Configuration templates can be uploaded individually or pulled automatically from an external source, such as a git repository. Rendered configurations can be retrieved via the REST API for application directly to network devices via a provisioning tool such as Ansible or Salt.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Custom Scripts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-custom-scripts&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Custom Scripts&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#custom-scripts&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Complex workflows, such as provisioning a new branch office, can be tedious to carry out via the user interface. NetBox allows you to write and upload custom scripts that can be run directly from the UI. Scripts prompt users for input and then automate the necessary tasks to greatly simplify otherwise burdensome processes.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Automated Events&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-automated-events&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Automated Events&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#automated-events&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Users can define event rules to automatically trigger a custom script or outbound webhook in response to a NetBox event. For example, you might want to automatically update a network monitoring service whenever a new device is added to NetBox, or update a DHCP server when an IP range is allocated.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-heading&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Change Logging&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;user-content-comprehensive-change-logging&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-label=&quot;Permalink: Comprehensive Change Logging&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/netbox-community/netbox#comprehensive-change-logging&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); float: left; padding-right: 4px; margin: auto; line-height: 1; border-radius: 6px; opacity: 0; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex; position: absolute; top: 12.5px; left: -28px; transform: translateY(-50%); text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;NetBox automatically logs the creation, modification, and deletion of all managed objects, providing a thorough change history. Changes can be attributed to the executing user, and related changes are grouped automatically by request ID.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="2186" width="1220" x="5750" y="9104" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
